================================================================================
 Third-Party Software Licenses in SabakanOS
================================================================================

Distribution:  SabakanOS 0.1.0-dev (x86_64)
Release date:  2026-11-13
Maintained by: SabakanOS Project

This file lists the open source software (OSS) included in the SabakanOS ISO
image, together with each component's license terms, the location of the full
license text, and how to obtain the corresponding source code.

This file is not a license text itself. The full text of each license is
included on the ISO in the following directories:

    /usr/share/licenses/<component>/COPYING
    /usr/share/licenses/<component>/LICENSE
    /usr/share/licenses/<component>/LICENCE
    /usr/share/licenses/<component>/LICENSE.*

The SabakanOS build scripts, configuration files and documentation (the
works created for this project) are provided under the MIT License. See
/usr/share/licenses/sabakanos/LICENSE on the ISO and the LICENSE file at the
root of the repository. The MIT License does not replace or relicense the
bundled OSS.

Distributing this ISO image means distributing binaries covered by the GPL,
LGPL and other copyleft licenses. Everyone who redistributes this image must
therefore also make the complete corresponding source code of those
components available, as described in section 7.

The inventory is based on config/packages.txt (base packages) and
config/buildroot-defconfig (root filesystem composition). For the exact
composition of a given release, refer to the bundled source manifest and the
SBOM.


