--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Bootloader
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

 Component            | License                     | Location of full license text
----------------------+-----------------------------+--------------------------------
 Limine               | BSD-2-Clause                | /usr/share/licenses/limine/

The Limine binaries (limine-bios.sys, limine-efi.sys) are installed in /boot/
and /EFI/BOOT/ on the ISO.


