4. System Management and Utilities
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

 Component            | License                     | Location of full license text
----------------------+-----------------------------+--------------------------------
 sudo                 | ISC                         | /usr/share/licenses/sudo/
 procps-ng            | GPL-2.0-or-later /          | /usr/share/licenses/procps/
                      | LGPL-2.1-or-later           |
 cronie               | MIT and BSD                 | /usr/share/licenses/cronie/
 less                 | GPL-3.0-or-later or         | /usr/share/licenses/less/
                      | BSD-2-Clause (dual)         |
