9. About Updates
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This file is updated whenever the components bundled in the ISO change. The
repository's docs/license.md contains the detailed policy and the pre-release
checklist. If the contents of this file and docs/license.md ever disagree, the
copy of this file bundled in the released ISO is authoritative.

